WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.752
- Places, everyone.

00:00:03.921 --> 00:00:05.547
I'm Cody.
I'm a Helpster.

00:00:05.631 --> 00:00:08.217
That means a monster who helps.
Come on in.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:09.760
- ALL: Hurray!

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:11.762
- I lead a whole team of Helpsters.

00:00:11.845 --> 00:00:13.722
- I like how you run this place.

00:00:13.805 --> 00:00:15.182
- Well, thank you so much, sir.

00:00:15.265 --> 00:00:17.809
And everyday,
we help new friends...

00:00:17.893 --> 00:00:18.769
- Helpsters!

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:20.229
- ...solve new problems.

00:00:20.312 --> 00:00:22.147
- I have a problem.
- I have a problem.

00:00:22.231 --> 00:00:23.482
- We have a problem.

00:00:23.565 --> 00:00:26.401
- How can we help you?

00:00:26.735 --> 00:00:28.695
♪ High fives and handshakes ♪

00:00:28.779 --> 00:00:30.656
- We have our plan.

00:00:30.739 --> 00:00:33.325
Every leader should be... kind.

00:00:33.408 --> 00:00:36.578
Well, all right, let's get
started on that paper airplane.

00:00:36.662 --> 00:00:37.538
- That's very nice.
- Thank you.

00:00:37.621 --> 00:00:39.122
- Sometimes silly.

00:00:39.206 --> 00:00:40.123
I love dance parties.

00:00:40.207 --> 00:00:42.584
♪ Shake that fuzz,
shake that fuzz ♪

00:00:42.668 --> 00:00:43.877
- Creative...

00:00:43.961 --> 00:00:47.297
We could use some things
in this room to make a pretend sailboat.

00:00:47.381 --> 00:00:50.592
- You're so good.
- And most of all... helpful!

00:00:50.676 --> 00:00:53.470
- She's the best at clues.
She helped me find my lunch.

00:00:53.554 --> 00:00:54.638
- Where was it?

00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:55.806
- In my belly.

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:58.976
- We did it, everybody!
Yeah, we did.

00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:01.061
♪ High fives and handshakes ♪

00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:05.649
♪ High fives and handshakes ♪

